Subject: [PATCH] plugins: retain registered pending constructor custody

Retain the complete Crucible integration on the sole pinned QEMU base.
Supply required run and teardown rows with real compiled fixture layouts
and same-module exported C component providers. Derive modeled allowance
from the genuine backing planner and retain the original 1 MiB refusal.
Assert exact issued claims, retained roster/worker charges and task plans,
while preserving required-role omissions and every cleanup behavior.

Admit the actual source-built glibc 2.39 cohort after auditing its GNU
release allocator, TLS and user-stack thread paths. Keep the existing
2.42 cohort and every loader, allocator, environment and THP refusal.
The unchanged bound covers 32 KiB heap/header minimum, 128 KiB top-pad,
1 MiB morecore fallback, backing-page rounding, actual control requests,
DTV max-module-id plus 14 surplus and two headers, tcache (64 bins under
2.39, bounded by 76), and each loaded TLS size plus alignment. Explicit
user stacks contain pthread/first TSD/static TLS and bypass stack caches;
first-thread signal setup allocates nothing. Refuse changed environment
inputs and invalid stacks without charge or birth. Task/TLS accounting
does not prove physical libc backing return.

Repair serialized component dependency closures with literal native helper
bodies and configured genuine QOM support/linker objects. Keep bounded
component providers separate from that linked support and preserve original
compiler target options. Retain the genuine linked RCU worker after its
actual callback drain, including its native registry and task census;
never erase or relabel the record. Refresh exact input fingerprints.

Preserve configured healthy completion with actual C Bridge/Child placement,
registration holder transfer, bounded RUN/teardown task enrollment and entry,
RUN socket handoff, semaphore lifetime, close/join/control destruction and
stack/Bridge/Child storage return. Bound join observations by the same
retained installing and containing deadlines, without renewing admission.
Keep exact residual history charged. Reach the unavailable-runtime negative
through actual controller reservation before its disclosed scratch input.
Prepared-family and completion enrollment remain isolated modeled inputs;
no worker born, ready or returned flag is seeded. These component lifetimes
qualify no standing, entered Original, production Rust module, Source/CPU
activation or launched lifecycle/VM behavior. The mandatory launched capture
lifecycle refusal remains unchanged.

Retain a completed actual command-reader journal in one paid inline delivery
owner, including born-negative output. Pin the real receive/member/lender,
authenticate thread/process and nonwrapping serials, and retain the exact
original creation output before canonical Runtime transfer. Refuse copied
creation/use holders, stale serials, saturation and reissue from the same
still-retained receive. Local same-thread uses pin only this lifetime; the
single paid use slot admits no worker, nested or multi-vCPU cohort. Identity
and use returns consume only on zero under the registry mutex and preserve
all holders on every negative. Returning local delivery leaves the received
request, module payload epoch and publisher/peer obligations retained.

Exercise literal receive/delivery bodies with an actual registered C reader,
real mutex/thread/process/runtime storage, and explicit modeled member and
standing boundary inputs. These component controls issue no action Original,
module payload ownership, ACK, ActionReturn, Source/CPU activation or launched
lifecycle qualification. Preserve the mandatory launched-lifecycle refusal.

First-bind module payload claim/release with member v3 to the genuine retained
complete child. Keep v2 explicitly payload-unavailable. Journal the exact paid
Source field, module-local serial and real transition before the masked callback
outside Source's mutex. Retain every born pair and uncertainty independently of
callback status and physical post; refuse local identity return with actual
payload, borrowers or transition debt. No standing/Original query is inferred.
Save genuine release destruction/nulling before independent post so a negative
post cannot resurrect payload debt. Preserve the first release diagnostic even
when a later actual retry consumes; pure local return independently records the
closed delivery lifetime. Parent receive and publisher/peer obligations remain.

Exercise literal v3 construction/transfer with a real C reader-deposited child
journal, exact canonical claim and destruction, actual journal-lock borrowers,
born-negative custody, half-pair/duplicate binding refusals, copied field/serial
refusals, reentrant transition exclusion, partial/contradictory output retention,
and consumed-before-negative-post cleanup. Installation and standing inputs are
explicitly modeled; this is no production Rust child, operational payload use,
action Original, ACK, ActionReturn, Source activation or VM qualification.

Nominate each actual received journal at birth inside Source's authenticated
Ready factual callback. Claim completion alone may retain its exact canonical
module payload field/local serial, first-bound child/member and standing lender
in a paid Source handoff. The actual execution carrier retains the exact Source
interior before independent post and normal observation return; this physical
pin survives Ready exit without extending or reusing its entered marker.
Preserve born-negative custody and block actual payload, delivery and execution
return until dependencies close. No copied facts or caller tuple creates it.

Provide factual ready_return consumption independently from signed status.
Authenticate the real delivery, exact execution holder and actual local uses;
record real consumption before independent post. Missing physical consumption
becomes uncertain refusal, never output success. Absence/completed return is
terminal for that delivery and preserves the first return error across retry.
Exercise literal Source/coordinator dispatch and holder-return bodies with
explicitly modeled installation, standing and Main-loop entry inputs, keeping
all earlier controls. Ready retention alone supplies no CPU operation use,
action Original, Source activation, ACK, ActionReturn or launched qualification.

At the actual Main control boundary retain its genuine CONTROL descriptor/group
use and QOM CPU reference with the Source allocation receipt and generation.
Authenticate the exact installed core dispatch field, thread/process and real
CPU roster before publishing a distinct factual Native frame. Before independent
post retain an exact paid Source borrower of the Ready handoff, canonical module
payload field, first-bound child/member and standing lender. Neither copied
holders nor first_cpu equality issues this loan or CPU operation permission.

Keep the Main invocation/return journal separate from Stop admission. Preserve
born-negative outputs; block Ready, payload and delivery cleanup while a real
Main borrower remains. Close actual QOM and Native descriptor dependencies before
consuming the Source holder and independently checking post. Retain uncertain
transitions, and never resurrect physical custody after a negative post. Actual
nested masks prevent return; real QOM finalizers run while the descriptor/frame
and Source borrower remain pinned. Keep fixed pools and all existing limits.

Exercise literal Core dispatch, Native registry and Source borrower bodies with
real mutex/thread/process identity, QOM reference/finalizer execution and actual
nested mask return. Installed publication, allocator observation, Main/BQL entry
and a minimal CPU class remain explicitly modeled component inputs. Preserve all
earlier scenarios and causal controls. This physical custody cut grants no CPU
operation, entered action Original, publisher membership, activation, ACK,
ActionReturn, peer return or launched lifecycle/VM qualification.

First-bind v4 member callbacks for one prepaid nominal module-payload lifetime
borrow under the exact Main owner. Authenticate the canonical payload field and
local serial through the retained child journal. Keep older member editions
explicitly borrow-unavailable, and refuse half-pairs before member birth.

Journal invocation before the masked callback, keeping exact stable holder and
serial output fields. Accept known absence only from a genuine empty NULL/0
negative refusal; retain unknown or contradictory outputs. Preserve born-negative
records and independent acquire/status/post facts. Release authenticates the
actual born token and original serial, clears both original output fields, and
records real consumption before independent callback status and Source post.
Neither a scalar output nor a copied field can close the physical dependency.

The actual Core Main exit attempts module return before QOM, Native descriptor
and Source borrower return. Unknown or unconsumed module debt retains those exact
owners and the Ready handoff, blocks parent teardown and subsequent dispatch,
and ends the real entered marker. No stale Main phase authorizes later retry;
a genuine cleanup entry producer remains required for that terminal containment.

Exercise literal Native/Source/Core consumers with a modeled module journal,
explicitly modeled installed publication/allocation/Main entry inputs, genuine
mutex/process/thread identity, exact field custody and independent post errors.
Preserve existing scenarios and limits. Local opaque lifetime borrowing exports
no payload reference, action/class, entered Original, publisher membership, CPU
operation permission, activation, ACK, ActionReturn or physical peer return.
It does not qualify the actual module/QEMU pairing or launched lifecycle.

Require CRUCSRV4/schema4 standing records with big-endian producer-retention
edition1 at offset196. Preserve the 1496/1504/1520 publication extents and
process-purpose8 envelope. Bind the declaration in the sealed initial record,
require it on subsequent observations and reject every predecessor, zero and
unknown edition before producing output. Rename every actual decoder caller,
including the preinit literal closure, and refresh exact fixture fingerprints.

Document the producer promise: every born row, including dirty/unprojected
rows, stays retained; exposed matching actions are irrevocably pending before
request publication and cannot race unpublished abandonment. Exact action birth
cannot be replaced until authenticated assigned-peer local closure. Local
subscriber closure never retires publisher-owned rows, and producer death or
unknown cleanup does not certify physical return. This compatibility cut does
not yet construct a Source subscription or issue operation/action authority.

Exercise current syntax plus predecessor, edition, byte-order and unchanged
output refusals. Retain prior native causal timeout and launched lifecycle
failures as unresolved observations; no decoder or component result qualifies
activation, Original, publisher membership, ACK or ActionReturn.

Complete the lifetime component's real constructor-RCU prerequisite before its
foreign-process identity control forks. A child otherwise can restart RCU while
inheriting the thread-registry mutex held by the vanished constructor helper.
Drain actual RCU callbacks, then inspect the real registry under that mutex:
exactly one retained RCU_RESTART helper, its coordinator, no overflow and no
in-flight starts. Expose the actual starts counter in process-private inventory
only. Keep the helper record alive, every process-refusal assertion and all
existing build/test ceilings. No sleep, synthetic readiness or fork grant is
substituted. Refresh exact extractor fingerprints after the native header edit.

The fixture starts no other QEMU threads in this scenario; actual callback
completion follows thread registration, start-end consumption and RCU reader
registration. This closes a concrete inherited-lock race, not the production
hot-fork admission contract. Independently rebuilt retained-start debt refuses
before fork. Preserve failed prior causal attempts and the mandatory launched
Source/Root lifecycle refusal until their respective fresh checks qualify.


Capture a nominal publisher subscription only from the actual outside-BQL Ready
handoff, completed matching receive, canonical payload, first-bound member,
assigned mapping and installed schema-4 retention promise. Require its complete
born/projected Running cohort and retain the exact sequence before independent
post. Main action children borrow that owner; decoded equality cannot issue it.
Single sequence-current drift refusal avoids coherent standing reads under BQL.

Separate local view closure from a prepaid terminal writer. Close actual Main,
semantic and Ready children, then physically destroy the canonical module
payload before publishing local closure. Retain delivery/member/mapping/lender
through uncertainty. Observe but never clear the Host birth hold. Publish the
184-byte CRUCRET1 record with checked nonwrapping atomic sequence CAS/stores/CAS,
saving real final-CAS consumption before independent post. Preserve first/post
failures separately; issue no progress witness or publisher row retirement.

First-bind member v5 semantic enter/current/post/return to its retained complete
child. Construct the actual Source action only inside the genuine entered Main
callback route, with its nominal subscriber and canonical v4 payload borrower.
Keep raw callback/post outcomes separate from born token and physical return.
Authenticate actual Main/Native frames, semantic evidence and immutable row
limits, including an independent containing Preparation row. Actual async
material retains that same action and frozen limits after callback exit; later
physical cleanup cannot revive CALLING. Close semantic action before v4 payload,
QOM/CPU, Source Main and descriptor return. Final module evidence precedes exact
canonical consumption; save consumption before independently refusing an
incomplete healthy return. Legacy member editions remain semantic-unavailable.

Component controls exercise literal custody and writer bodies with real C
payload journals, QOM retention and writable atomic mapping. Standing/assigned
installation and local semantic boundary inputs are explicitly modeled; these
controls do not qualify the installed Rust semantic path or launched lifecycle.
Retain every original scenario, resource ceiling and refusal. Independently
rebuilt publisher and literal evidence defects must fail their causal assertions.
Add five explicitly GPL-2.0-or-later files and retain all existing file licenses.
Keep prior failed causal attempts and mandatory launched lifecycle refusal
visible; no operation/activation or peer-return qualification follows from
compilation or modeled component success.


Include the newly referenced actual Core Main/action predicates and their real
inactive journal declarations in the owning Source/Native extractor closure.
No fixture may replace those predicates with successful authority providers.
Preserve the first incomplete-closure link failure as a failed build attempt.

Retain selected initial CPU callbacks under the actual stopped construction
Original. Defer enqueue until each actual Source allocation receipt exists,
retain its canonical QOM participant and registration group, and complete the
real CPU FIFO callback/barrier before construction Post. Authenticate distinct
callback entry, return and final physical consumption; pre-enqueue refusal
closes only the actual unentered child. Check actual roster generation after
QOM unref before advancing its iterator. No FIFO marker invents callback return.

Guard selected realized capability, manifest, bind, seal and register-list SDK
factories with the actual class-0 child and exact Core/Native callback. Preserve
independent first/post failures. Their missing bounded native constructor payer
still refuses before factory allocation with ENOKEY; unselected paths keep their
existing behavior. Generic VCPU_INIT remains factual and inactive; no new
workspace, operation, activation, ACK or physical peer-return permission exists.

Charge the actual Core initial-dispatch static extent and enlarged actual CPU
allocation owner through their existing paid layouts. Extract the real storage
and getter for component sizing, retaining exact source and dependency guards.
Add two explicitly GPL-2.0-or-later includes. Literal clock and SDK-history tests
exercise independent total/progress/clock and signed-history omission controls.
The assertion-only actual initial callback hooks remain unexecuted pending the
genuine installed-module launch harness; compilation and pure predicate tests
cannot qualify that route. Preserve original ceilings, all previous failed
attempts and mandatory launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal.

Replace the hardware manifest and binding GArrays with the actual bounded
six-row/six-binding typed declaration. Preserve ordinary architecture branches,
ordering and binding behavior; refuse sticky overflow before publication.
Charge the entire declaration once through its genuine installation floor,
including its inactive lease and terminal journals, for the image lifetime.

Retain the private paired hardware constructor lease under the actual initial
CPU child, QOM allocation receipts, fixed account and construction Original.
Keep actual Native issuing/holder predicates and post-ATEXIT process/thread
scope distinct from installation or callback facts. Terminal return requires
real registry retirement and worker, material, action, Main, Ready, Park and
initial-CPU closure, plus no registered handlers, staged VMState or pending events.
Consume logical lease dependencies only after unpublication; static image
backing remains charged. Selected public SDK and internal lazy builders remain
prebirth-refused. These inactive seams do not qualify an accepted constructor,
executed callback, operation, activation or physical peer return.

Refuse selected register and interrupt lazy factories before CPU lookup or
cached-row reuse, retaining unselected preconditions and behavior. Extract the
actual typed catalogue declaration/getter and enlarged Core dispatch journal
for component sizing; retain exact source/dependency fingerprints. Run literal
storage/branch, selected refusal and physical-debt controls with independent
omission mutations, and document actual installed-runner/factory prerequisites.
Add two explicitly GPL-2.0-or-later focused tests and preserve every existing
file license, assertion and resource limit. Initial callback and lease assertion
hooks remain unexecuted; retain all prior failed attempts and the mandatory
launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal.

Replace the interrupt manifest, bindings and target arrays with the actual
bounded typed 13-row, 13-binding and 4096-target catalogue. Preserve ordinary
architecture templates, ordering and realized-device evidence requirements;
refuse sticky row/target overflow before publication. Charge the exact image
storage once in the real fixed Native floor, without paying device strings,
registrations, handlers or future constructors by implication.

Keep selected SDK and internal prebirth refusals unchanged. Exercise actual
register_family, builder, binding and sealing bodies with explicit CPU and
realized-capability inputs; independently rebuild missing-evidence, selected
refusal and target-overflow defects. Preserve the earlier register/interrupt
refusal controls under the actual typed layout. These facts issue no Source
payer, accepted lease, entered callback, operation or activation authority.

Extract the actual typed declaration and getter, guard every new source input,
and run the new GPL-2.0-or-later focused test from the existing native driver.
Retain its actual GLib link dependency from configured QEMU provider metadata.
Preserve every earlier assertion, resource ceiling, failed attempt and mandatory
launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal; initial callback and lease hooks remain
unexecuted.

Count the actual realized AArch64 register registry without constructing a
sorted key workspace. Share the existing eligibility predicate with the
unchanged sorted-key path; preserve explicit exception, EL and SVE rules and
saturate an unrepresentable count rather than wrapping. Geometry preflight is
a storage fact, not a Source payer, accepted lease, live callback or operation.

Compare literal count and sorted keys against the independently frozen prior
eligibility rule across feature/exception variants and the over-limit registry.
Rebuild allocating-count and eligibility-change controls to their intended
assertions. Integrate the GPL-2.0-or-later component into the actual native
driver with its real configured GLib dependency and guard exact source inputs.
Preserve every original ceiling/refusal, prior failed attempt, unexecuted
initial hook and mandatory launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal. Descriptor
workspace, runtime/read and lifetime funding remain separate and unavailable.

Add architecture-owned factual register geometry, complete sorted key views
and allocation-free descriptor writers for realized ARM and x86 cohorts.
Use caller-retained name and four independent mask spans; check actual current
geometry, eligibility, ordering, capacities, overflow and disjoint spans before
publishing each descriptor. Preserve allocating wrappers' ownership and prior
feature/exception/SVE names and mask semantics. These process-private CPUClass
hooks issue no Source payer, manifest constructor, callback or operational use.

Exercise literal producer/helper bodies with explicit feature/registry and
caller-storage inputs. Rebuild capacity, geometry, key-order and eligibility
defects to their intended assertions; retain count and prebirth refusal controls.
Integrate exact helper/producer/header dependencies and two explicitly
GPL-2.0-or-later files into the corresponding source and ledger. Keep selected acceptance
closed; runtime/read/lifetime funding and installed callback qualification remain
unavailable. Preserve previous failures, unchanged limits and mandatory launched
Source/Root lifecycle refusal; no workspace lease, activation, ACK or peer return.

Derive checked typed workspace spans from actual realized register geometry,
including complete name/mask scratch bounds. Retain the stopped initial CPU
cohort through canonical Source and Native holders. Debit anonymous backing
before mmap, preserve independent first/post outcomes, and refund only after
actual munmap0 or the completed no-map branch. Exclude that same held debit
once from observer allowance rather than charging it twice.

Keep registry-owned QOM/allocation dependencies outside mapped bytes, retain
uncertain unmap and run QOM return outside the registry mutex. A prepaid return
cursor records actual unref before retry so a destroyed CPU is never reread or
unrefed twice. Charge actual inline Source and Native journals in the existing
fixed floor. This private storage seam remains disconnected from selected
factories; selected SDK/internal prebirth refusal is unchanged.

Integrate real declaration/getter/header/include dependencies into native
fixture extraction and run literal layout arithmetic plus five independently
rebuilt overflow, alignment, separation, page-rounding and width controls.
Keep explicit layout/geometry inputs distinct from an installed provider.
The corrected overlap control reaches pairwise separation; its earlier
bounds-hit attempt remains distinct evidence. Add four explicitly
GPL-2.0-or-later files and preserve all prior licenses and resource limits.
Actual installed mapping, unmap, QOM-return and initial callback paths remain
unexecuted. No accepted manifest, operation, activation, ACK or physical peer
return is qualified; retain all historical failures and mandatory launched
Source/Root lifecycle refusal.

Embed a canonical permanent registration owner in the actual Node handler
allocation. Authenticate actual producer membership, exact holder, process and
synchronous construction before append. Bind impulse publication to the real
entered append interval, reject duplicate/sealed registration before changing
existing edges, and propagate actual refusal before manifest registered flags.
Keep non-Node legacy behavior and selected preallocation refusal unchanged.

Authenticate process and nominal identity before inherited mutexes, repeat
identity under the fault lock, and observe only real registry/pending edges.
Retirement stays refused while callback, restore, rule, CPU and module closure
is unjoined. Add the actual Submit/VMState-prepare validation dispatch frame and
inline child with exact identity, nonwrapping issuance, copied command, saved
first/post and actual call return; no selected payer is supplied.

Charge both real fixed registry/append/validation declarations through their
actual getters. Extract those literal declarations with their owning header,
guard exact sources and run foreign/copy/locked-fork/missing-interval refusal
controls from the native driver with its configured GLib provider. These tests
keep the real producer registry empty and cannot create an owner. Add three
explicitly GPL-2.0-or-later files, preserving licenses, ceilings and assertions.
Genuine born construction, duplicate registration, callback and retirement
remain unexecuted; no selected availability, operation, activation, ACK or
physical peer return is qualified. Preserve historical failed attempts and
mandatory launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal.

Close the legacy TCG queue fixture's new dependencies with actual empty Node
producer declarations, registry/observer and thread helper bodies. Keep its
non-Node bounded handler and every queue/completion/restore assertion. An
unexpected Source selection query aborts instead of creating admission; no
nominal owner or selected provider is supplied. Independently rebuild all
three original queue/completion/restore omissions to their intended assertions.
Retain the earlier broad-prefix compilation failure as a failed full sweep,
separate from the unchanged mandatory launched Source/Root refusal.

Join actual Node pending control to its canonical registration before row and
payload birth. Keep the real control across queue unlink and entered arm,
prepare, commit and free-state calls. Save actual outputs and physical return
before independent post, and retain prepaid retirement cursors across row,
payload and control destruction without reading freed storage or repeating frees.

Retain a separately born command-VMState staging owner with nonwrapping local
issuance and genuine construction, publication, commit and cleanup intervals.
Release its actual child only after the queue handoff, and preserve uncertain
retirement. Charge the actual fixed custody registry and cursors through the
existing inventory getter. Keep selected preallocation ENOKEY, full registration
return ENOTSUP and non-Node behavior unchanged.

Extract literal pending declarations, types and getter into native floor tests,
and expand the actual pending include in the legacy TCG queue fixture. Preserve
all original assertions using the genuine stage constructor/publication and a
separate translation unit containing the literal unselected Source singleton
and retained accessor. Bounded non-Node rows remain explicit restore inputs;
the fixture creates no selected owner or Source admission. Rebuild empty-provider
foreign, copied, missing-interval and locked-fork refusal controls independently.
Add the explicit GPL-2.0-or-later pending include and preserve all prior licenses,
assertions and resource ceilings. Genuine owned Node birth/callback, stream
restore/handoff and physical retirement remain unexecuted. Preserve historical
failed attempts and the mandatory launched Source/Root lifecycle refusal; no
selected payer, operation, activation, ACK or peer physical return is qualified.

Resolve the real configured support closure from one per-call authenticated
compile-output list shared by event-loop and QOM selections. Every command,
canonical output, source, compiler, complete membership and physical file check
remains; no cross-call cache or mutant-object reuse is introduced. This removes
duplicate compile-database decoding without changing native resource limits,
assertions or independent causal compilation.

The first pending-custody causal positive exceeded its unchanged 60-second
limit before the 34 defects. Two exact-source diagnostic positives also timed
out during registration compiler invocations, with and without core files.
These failed attempts remain evidence; neither diagnostic qualifies the gate.

Retain actual node temporary-state, copied-rule and event-reservation storage
membership through reference return and payload destruction. Serialize ordinary
recursive storage operations and preserve prepaid retirement cursors through
unpublication, independent post refusal and the real pending FREE_STATE receipt.
Distinguish prepared reservation discard from live event-credit release.

Keep the actual storage registry and cursors in the existing node fixed getter.
