in the non-Node TCG fixture. Preserve its original assertions and omissions.
Add actual ordinary reservation construction, split, consume, release, discard
and failed-post controls to the component sweep; they provide no registered
Node, Source payer, ARM, copied-rule consumer or aggregate-restore qualification.
Selected construction stays refused and full registration return unsupported.

Exercise ordinary registered Node custody through actual initialized system
entry and the unchanged resident-RAM observer. Use complete matching system
objects and rebuild actual Source, Native, Core, API, VL and every fault provider
from the same retained public source. Refuse incompatible private layouts;
append observations to actual producer bodies rather than supplying an issuer.

Check genuine registration, duplicate impulse retention, Submit PREPARE_ONLY,
upsert, remove and real callback/storage physical receipts. Independently rebuild
validation, pending and storage journal omissions to their intended assertions.
Retain actual commands, provider/header identities and binary runtime transcripts.
The external complete-build fixture provides ordinary component evidence only:
selected construction, full registration retirement, aggregate restore, deferred
consumers, CPU borrowers and mandatory launched Source lifecycle remain unavailable
or unqualified. Preserve every original limit, failed attempt and refusal.

Authenticate each configured output once when the declared output and actual
compiler operand are byte-identical. Differently spelled values still resolve
independently, and all command, containment, compiler, support-cohort and
physical-object checks remain. Share no result across provider calls or causal
controls. Preserve canonical exact-value equivalence and all seven comparison
cases, including differently spelled same-path identity and genuine refusals.
The preceding ordinary causal positive timed out at its original 60-second
bound before any defect; retain that failure independently of diagnostic costs
and subsequent qualification. No assertion, resource ceiling or selected
