first complete build failure: all 3863 targets built, with mandatory launched
lifecycle refusal and prepark duplicate-inventory refusal (24 of 26 fixtures).
The corrected pin ownership grants no execution or admission authority.

Reauthenticate the actual canonical Source Original and genuine Core/Native
callback interval after every module-current callback. Preserve its exact
