identity, publisher and closure checks and add the independent pre-lock
boundary checks. Retain the exact payload, Source/Ready borrower, Native
ticket and QOM while action custody remains live or uncertain. Save first
return and payload-post failures independently across later cleanup attempts;
a negative result alone neither proves nor prevents actual physical closure.

Run literal Main-return refusal and four independently rebuilt omission
controls with an actual Source closed predicate and abort-only dependent
edges. They issue no successful module action, payer or physical return.
Preserve the configured compiler working directory, existing RR controls,
authenticated input closures and every original assertion and limit.
Genuine provider-backed action closure, selected admission, Quantum/Advance
issuance and the mandatory launched lifecycle remain unavailable or unqualified.

Add caller-storage ARM and x86 register read, validate-write and write hooks
that require current geometry, the complete caller-owned key view and exact
