+before ``out``. Its struct tag is forward-declared before that constructor;
+the complete definition follows here. Both tables must be complete, exact-version/exact-size,
+stable through the call and disjoint from output and canonical journals. Source
+copies both by value. V2-v5 retain zero absence and their existing signatures.
