+ * @addr: virtual address at which to begin the write
+ * @data: bytes to write
+ * @len: number of bytes to write
+ *
+ * This Crucible-only helper accepts writes only from the serialized exact
+ * resume callback for @vcpu_index, before that vCPU resumes guest execution.
+ * Explicit vCPU selection prevents an RR-wide resume sweep from depending on
+ * ambient current_cpu state.
