+ * single-thread RR callback owns one active vCPU, from an exact deterministic
+ * main-loop boundary that holds the BQL after every vCPU is quiescent, or while
+ * the VM is stopped and the caller holds the BQL. It is side-effect-free with
+ * respect to guest state and fails in every concurrent or unowned context.
