+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+"""Check literal physical service leaves, never a registered Runtime issuer.
+
+Zeroed local journals qualify only the no-user predicate. Local span/return
+records qualify geometry and consumption accounting, not Source membership,
+payment, Original, callback drain, transfer or canonical service return.
+"""
