+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+"""Exercise production RR prepark, completion, settlement and futex event bodies.
+
+A deterministic scheduler injects the real completion BH at selected provider
+boundaries. The futex provider records an indefinite park rather than sleeping;
+intentional waits get an unrelated wake after their predicates are observed.
+No guest, translated TB, virtual-clock advance or real kernel futex is executed.
+"""
